# Slickshot Lockpicker's "Plot {2}{U}" (CR 702.170a): on turn 1 Bot1 has three mana from Moxen that make no blue and cannot plot
# (the {U} is missing). On turn 3 Mox Sapphire makes the {U}, and with two other Moxen it is plotted for exactly {2}{U}, the
# pool empty after; it cannot be cast from exile that turn. On turn 5 it is cast from exile without paying its mana cost, and as
# it enters its trigger gives the Lightning Bolt in Bot1's graveyard flashback: the Bolt is cast again for {R} and exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Slickshot Lockpicker
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
